{"seq": 257, "t_ms": 31495, "type": "review_note", "data": {"text": "- **Main caveat:** Coverage is low everywhere (top sites 8.2–22.7%, watch-list 2.6–4.4%), and the data are status observations only. Saturation could be over- or understated, and unmet demand is invisible, so the ranking cannot justify 20 new points.\n- **Numbers:** All 39 checked numbers trace to sources; none are untraced.\n- **Unsupported:** Report cites \"before 1 March 2027\" with no source, and the RISPARMIO clustering is inferred from names only."}}
